  "analytic": "A nonrestoring growing word eventually contains w^8: w^4 returns pose; two identical closed-pose words force even local visit multiplicity, zero full XOR, and an impossible bounded periodic physical orbit. Restoring zero-drift growing words similarly fail at w^2. Remaining whole-lap rotation is constant; four actual laps cancel the drift slope, preserving every actual read. Empty initial lap is a harmless index shift. Core odd-drift bundling is additionally retained when theta=0.",
